  "scope": "Partial pinned Blender 5.3 macOS arm64 CPU compositor normalized 2D FBM Fac/Color, own unlinked Uniform Vector and original unlinked scalar defaults. Private BLI fade/Perlin/FBM kernel v3, full-frame square pixels 4..8192, Perlin-call budget 18 and sampler budget 8. RGB requires BOTH 8 ULP and absolute 2^-20; alpha, lattice and Color.red/Fac are exact. ONLY direct output including group/reroute forwarding; RGB selection using Fac/Color from the same native Noise node; RGB selection using two Color nodes; or three pair means from six distinct Fac nodes (ADD then MULTIPLY .5). Every operation must contribute through exact typed edges and source/channel identities. Alpha 1 may be inline or one contributing VALUE op with value 1 and no inputs. No other wrappers or consumers, generic Math/Exposure/Gamma/MapRange, linked/computed controls, amplification, native GPU/EEVEE or image/spatial/pass mixtures.",
